B.hoQ=new A.ei("y2","2-year Treasury yield",u.q_,"Markets expect the Fed to keep rates higher for longer, or inflation to stay firm. Borrowing gets more expensive.","Markets expect rate cuts, or are running to safety because growth looks weaker.","Rate-hike or higher-for-longer bets are building.","Markets are pricing rate cuts or a growth scare.","At {v}, the 2-year has been moving at an ordinary pace over the last three months.","At {v}, the 2-year has moved about half a point or more in three months \u2014 rate expectations are shifting fast.","At {v}, the 2-year has moved a full point or more in three months \u2014 a violent repricing of the Fed path.",B.d95,B.cHu,"Rising short yields pressure long-duration growth stocks and housing-linked names; banks with floating-rate loans can benefit.",B.cMr,B.dmm)
