B.dmO=s(["Many small edges: several weak, different signals together can be steadier than one big idea. This is a concept; the app does not combine them for you yet.","Short holding: an idea that lasts days gets checked many more times than one that lasts years. This is a concept, not a setting here.","Costs first: a signal that wins before fees can lose after them. You can open the costs from Small edges and see.","Balanced long and short: betting on one stock against a similar one cancels part of the market's ups and downs. You can add the pairs signal from Small edges.","Leverage cuts both ways: borrowing to bet bigger grows losses as fast as gains. This is a concept, not a feature here.","Rules, not overrides: write the rules, test them, then leave them alone. Run readiness tells you when a build changed after its test."],t.s)
