B.hQX=new A.D("summary",B.W,'Set on a child of a `compact:"stack"` split (any node type): what its phone card shows. An object with `title` ({lang: text} ok), `icon`, `metric` (text, or a stat-shaped {table, agg, valueColumn, filter, format, raw, unit, label}), `counts` (a list of stat-shaped entries, plus `urgent:true` to tint a non-zero count and sort its card up the stack) and `items` ({table, titleColumn, subtitleColumn, iconColumn, icon, color, filter, sortColumn, sortDir, limit}; default 2, at most 5). Absent: titled by `tab`, with a row count for each table-bound view. `"inline"` renders the child in place with no card; `"hidden"` leaves it out on a phone.',B.l,null,!1)
