B.i0c=new A.D("popoverContent",B.W,"A node spec (wikipick-search-row-0906): when present, tapping opens an ANCHORED popup below the button instead of firing `action` \u2014 rendered via the normal node renderer, so whatever lives inside (e.g. an embedded `pick` control) behaves exactly as it would inline, with the same actions and host wiring. The anchored-popup alternative to a bottom sheet for a toolbar-style icon button. Ignored if `action` is also set (popoverContent wins) \u2014 a button does not fire both.",B.l,null,!1)
