B.hPA=new A.D("anchor",B.bG,'Opt-in chat thread: "bottom" renders a REAL scrolling, reverse-anchored list that fills its bounded parent height - newest row (last in sort order) sits at the bottom, history scrolls upward, the view stays at the newest row as items arrive. Works with `bubbles`. Use as the root body (or the one anchored list in a root column) together with a root `footer`. Absent -> the normal non-scrolling list.',B.dh8,null,!1)
