B.hcc=new A.dp("grouplog","A read-only log of a table's rows grouped by day / project / person (Dispatch's Done screen): search, project and person filters, a Log / Table switch, and the item's real page beside the log (on top when narrow). Rows show only what differs as chips; the table view hides columns that are the same on every row. Reopen writes `reopenStatus` and clears the finish date and finisher in one undo step.",B.diB,!1)
