B.hKj=new A.D("deleteHistory",B.a9,'logdelete-1008: opt-in no-data-loss mode for the \u22ee Delete text / Delete item options. Each delete first snapshots the entry (or the whole deleted subtree) into a "revision_of" record in edgesTable (empty from, to = the entry; never a containment edge, so it renders nowhere), and the UI offers Restore (stub button / toast). Default false: deletes are undoable only via board undo.',B.l,null,!1)
B.hQB=new A.D("deletedColumn",B.L,'Column stamped (ISO time) by Delete text to mark an entry as a deleted STUB \u2014 content cleared, row + replies kept, rendered as a muted "Entry deleted" line. Default "deletedAt".',B.l,null,!1)
B.hRk=new A.D("authorColumn",B.L,'Ref column holding WHO added the entry; new entries are stamped with the current user and each card shows a "by <name>" line.',B.l,null,!1)
