B.i5P=new A.D("markerPulse",B.a9,"Opt-in gentle breathing highlight (repeating opacity pulse, ~1s period) on every visible non-clustered pin \u2014 default off = today's plain pin rendering, unchanged. Purely visual: tap targets, spiderfy and detailPopup are unaffected. Pairs with `databars`' `play` for a \"time wave\" read (the strip sweeps, only that slot's pins show, and they breathe).",B.l,null,!1)
