B.hdi=new A.dp("compose","An auto-layout screen composer: a pannable workboard of device frames. Drop a widget chip and the screen RE-SOLVES as a real layout (top/bottom regions stack fixed-height chrome, the body splits remaining space among fill widgets) instead of drawing a static mock. Self-contained chip palette; flows draw light arrows widget->screen; a Play toggle tweens the camera to a tapped widget's linked screen. Powers the `composer` applet.",B.dxk,!1)
