B.hcY=new A.dp("wheel",'A scroll selector (wheel columns) for a number, a time of day or a date, bound to a board SETTING like `slider`. `mode` picks the shape: number (min/max/step/decimals/unit; fractional steps are exact), time (stored as "HH:mm"; 12h/24h follows the device) or date (stored as ISO "yyyy-MM-dd"). The wheel is a visible boxed field; drag, mouse wheel, keys and tap-to-type all work.',B.d2E,!1)
