B.i0b=new A.D("play",B.a9,'Opt-in auto-play cursor (default off): shows a small play/pause button that steps the selection one bar at a time left-to-right across the whole strip (sections group visually but never interrupt the sweep), publishing through the same choice-filter path a manual tap uses so every configSource:"board" subscriber follows the wave. Any manual tap/drag stops play in place.',B.l,null,!1)
