B.hbS=new A.dp("workgraph","A read-only work graph: a board's tasks drawn as git-style lines, one row per trail event, newest first (time, title, project, mark, note), with a Now row on top and a header per day. A grey released line runs down column 0; each task forks off it at its first event, merges back at each release and runs up to Now while still in flight. Marks: hollow ring = stopped by the checks, dot = on the test site, ringed dot = released, red diamond = waiting on you, small tick = status change. Tap a row to trace that task. At most 4 lane columns at 480px wide or less (excess clamps into the last).",B.dp6,!1)
