B.hd5=new A.dp("grouplist","One long list of rows in user-made groups. Rows drag by a handle within and between groups, groups drag by theirs; a drop writes only the group and order columns it changes. Each group has a color bar and a menu to rename, recolor or delete it (its rows stay). Sort (my order, last added, A to Z) and filter (status, groups, tags) are device settings. Rows with no group, or a group that is gone, always show at the end. Scrolls itself when given a bounded height (`fill: true` under a root `footer` layout).",B.d8Z,!1)
B.hSd=new A.D("groups",B.W,"REQUIRED. { table, nameColumn?, colorColumn?, orderColumn? } (defaults name, color, order), as on grouplist.",B.l,null,!1)
