B.hcf=new A.dp("recordtypes",'Settings list of the record-type catalog: each type expands to its fields (drag handle to reorder, type label on the right, tap to rename or remove with a confirm, "+ Add field"); a muted "+ New type (later)" row.',B.dp5,!1)
